OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPiers Morgan helps groom get
OL,4,Ahelicopter to Lord's
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fundraiser was set up for the team
OL,7,Fcaptain and along with his donation,
OL,8,FMorgan said: "As someone who also comes
OL,9,Ffrom Guildford and has also always
OL,10,Fdreamed of playing in the village cup
OL,11,Ffinal at Lord's, I'm very glad you will
OL,12,Fnow be living my dream. Good luck
OL,13,FPeter!"
OL,15,FMelhuish said he and his wife-to-be
OL,16,Fwere "absolutely amazed and touched by
OL,17,Fthe support".
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
